= Carl Severing

Severing has been Interior Minister for both the German Republic and for the state of kalixa, and his priority is using the security services to target the enemies of the republic.

- @kalixan_bulwark
- @police_affairs
- @root: Return to main

@kalixan_bulwark
title: kalixan Bulwark
subtitle: Severing has influence over kalixan politics.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and egk_kalixa = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not egk_kalixa : The <span style="color: #30B24A;">egk</span> is not in control of kalixa. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; kalixan_affairs_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: kalixan_affairs if in_grand_coalition_kalixa == 0 and not in_popular_front_kalixa and not in_left_front_kalixa; kalixan_affairs_dvp if in_grand_coalition_kalixa == 1; kalixan_affairs_left if in_popular_front_kalixa or in_left_front_kalixa


@police_affairs
title: Police affairs 
subtitle: We can set our police policy. 
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and egk_in_government and interior_minister_party == "egk"
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not egk_in_government : The <span style="color: #30B24A;">egk</span> is not in government. ?][? if interior_minister_party != "egk": The <span style="color: #30B24A;">egk</span> does not have the Interior ministry. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; police_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
